    {
      "text": "Diagram (Schéma 4.3.1) of three stakeholder groups of a digital health intervention, each with an icon and definition: \"Équipe de planification\" (stakeholders guiding the system's development), \"Utilisateurs finaux\" (health workers, and possibly clients or patients, who interact directly with the intervention) and \"Bénéficiaires\" (clients or community members who benefit from the system).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
